    'Suspicious Package': 'Keep away and notify site security or authorities from safety. Do not use fixed clearance distances unless local bomb-disposal authorities specify them.',
    'Crowd Emergency': 'Follow venue staff and police instructions. Crowd movement depends on the venue and event; evacuation routes must be locally planned.',
    'Home Intrusion': 'The cited police source is state-specific. Confirm advice with the local police and account for children, disability, and safe exits.',
    'Public Disturbance': 'Avoid filming or spreading unverified information if it draws attention or increases danger. Follow local police and venue directions.',
    'Missing Person': 'Preserve the last known location, time, clothing, and relevant medical needs for authorities. Protect personal data and avoid delaying urgent reports.',
    'Personal Safety Concern': 'Make a discreet plan with a trusted person. Reporting, safeguarding, and support options depend on the person’s circumstances and local services.',
    'Lost Outdoors': 'Before travel, share the route and return time, carry water and weather protection, and use locally appropriate maps and communication tools.',
    'Water Shortage': 'Prioritize official distribution and public-health advice. Individual fluid needs vary; people with medical conditions should follow clinician advice.',
    'Extended Isolation': 'Plan water, essential medicines, sanitation, accessible communications, and check-ins. Seek help early when supplies or health needs become unsafe.',
